  "description": "<p>This addon opens up the NORVAIR store on ground zero - it requires a new key to open.</p>\n<p>Lots of loot spawns/containers/objects are inside, so the key is costly, but can be found in vanilla containers, as well as a couple of dedicated rare loose key spawns near the store.</p>\n<p>There is also a key for the cash register.</p>\n<h2>Images</h2>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/ShaneeexD/SPT-NORVAIR/blob/main/after1.png?raw=true\" alt=\"3N6gTe2.gif\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/ShaneeexD/SPT-NORVAIR/blob/main/after2.png?raw=true\" alt=\"3N6gTe2.gif\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/ShaneeexD/SPT-NORVAIR/blob/main/after3.png?raw=true\" alt=\"3N6gTe2.gif\" /></p>\n",
